index 037ff321..1d243d4f 100644
--- a/Changelog.md
+++ b/Changelog.md
@@ -736,3 +736,13 @@ feat: Add option to change load game slots text
 * I figured out how to change the text that shows up on the load game slots, and only set one slot to show up.
 
